[0.137, "o", "\u001b[11;7H\u001b[38;5;45;49m2\u001b[12;2H\u001b[38;5;139;49mThere are already ~84 test modules across the two crates, so \"more tests\" on its own isn't a change anybody can land — and \"test oracle\" means\u001b[13;2Hat least three different things: a property-based generator with invariants, a differential check against a second independent implementation,\u001b[14;2Hor golden/snapshot files that record known-good output.\u001b[16;2HWhich behaviour is currently hard to trust? Freshness (hash → stale/fresh), document rendering, or brief/slice parsing?\u001b[46;1H\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;45;49m┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[47;1H│\u001b[22m\u001b[7m\u001b[39;49m \u001b[47;145H\u001b["]
